Files adapted from PaperOrchestra, all modified:
- agents/*.md, except checker.md and materials-drafter.md: adapted from the prompt and agent files that each one names in its notice line;
- prompts/ground-rules.md: adapted from utils/prompt_utils.py; the agents repeat these rules;
- styles/ml-conference.md: adapted from templates/iclr2025/guidelines.md and templates/cvpr2025/guidelines.md.

Modifications:
- ported from Gemini API calls to Claude Code agents
- Markdown output instead of LaTeX
- adapted ground rules for unpublished research
- honest Limitations section
- reviewers' experiment requests kept as a to-do list
- abstract-less papers kept with limited use
- the figure pipeline without the few-shot example bank, with Mermaid diagrams
- the reviser works on a marked draft in both hand-edit modes
- the literature scout receives the broader project problem
- the Check stage replaces the PDF compile and format loop

tests/fixtures/tsam is derived from frontend/examples/cvpr_example.json of PaperOrchestra (Apache-2.0).
